{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5d74ec6c62946b0b","name":"Bail Antilles","source":{"id":"source:reference-5d74ec6c62946b0b","title":"Bail Antilles","revision":16116,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:18Z","sha256":"96be50aab89b39b1ae7b34311489ec69fbd52a1a84b72c878e073eb738172a01","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16116","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Bail%20Antilles&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5d74ec6c62946b0b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Bail Antilles comes from a family dedicated to governmental service. His family name combined with his personal charisma and connections allow him to rise through the Galactic Government and ultimately be voted in as a member of the Triumvirate. He is known to carefully consider all options, and is not beholden to any specific policy or organization. He is level headed and often provides the swing vote between the other two members of the Triumvirate, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gial Gahan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gial_Gahan","referenceId":"reference:c6403aa375231b89"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nu Toreena"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nu_Toreena","referenceId":"reference:30ad879f1ed6fe9b"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Bail casts the deciding vote to engage the Empire at the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Caamas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Caamas","referenceId":"reference:325a6657b633ffd9"},". He hopes that a quick victory over the Empire might stop member worlds from leaving ",{"tag":"a","children